{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Battle of Orks</i> is a shared-screen co-op game that blends orks with slot machine mechanics! Summon your orks, enter the fray, and lead your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/c3cdc0f2207953c035cdeb77329af2da.poster.avif?t=1769421872\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/c3cdc0f2207953c035cdeb77329af2da.webm?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/c3cdc0f2207953c035cdeb77329af2da.mp4?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinctive Orks with Unique Styles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Battle of Orks</i>, you\u2019ll build your team from a unique cast of orks before each battle. Each ork belongs to a clan, and picking a clan \u201cleader\u201d will grant powerful bonuses to help shape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/eb9609c4f2bc2462bc930844c33a0e5e.poster.avif?t=1769421872\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/eb9609c4f2bc2462bc930844c33a0e5e.webm?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/eb9609c4f2bc2462bc930844c33a0e5e.mp4?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World Challenges, Command Your Ork Warriors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your ork champions into battles against various NPCs. Strategize and position your team wisely to outsmart opponents. With each victory, recruit more ork allies, expand your roster, and build the ultimate ork army that's uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/ca880f5af0b07c4e5e3b5c9b1171af7b.poster.avif?t=1769421872\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/ca880f5af0b07c4e5e3b5c9b1171af7b.webm?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/ca880f5af0b07c4e5e3b5c9b1171af7b.mp4?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-Time Competition of Strategy and Luck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules are simple: pull the lever to summon orks! But winning takes a clever strategy\u2014place double bets at key moments to score more coins and maximize your rewards. Landing three  three matching symbols might even summon a special ork, whose skills and buffs can shift the battle in your favor. Stay sharp and use them wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/945d3a88f780957e7b89719af78cf32b.poster.avif?t=1769421872\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/945d3a88f780957e7b89719af78cf32b.webm?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/945d3a88f780957e7b89719af78cf32b.mp4?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3158040?t=1769421872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/749a9a819fded5f84680542c78de5d63762058b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769421872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/2012d082d15b5049162b429ad0e03821bd12d092/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769421872","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/2012d082d15b5049162b429ad0e03821bd12d092/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769421872","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Battle of Orks</i> is a shared-screen co-op game that blends orks with slot machine mechanics! Summon your orks, enter the fray, and lead your team to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/c3cdc0f2207953c035cdeb77329af2da.poster.avif?t=1769421872\" width=1068 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3158040/extras/c3cdc0f2207953c035cdeb77329af2da.webm?t=1769421872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto